Apple Silicon sensor-name tables
------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Apple Silicon SMC sensor-name tables in Sources/SpeedyFan/SensorNames.swift
are community knowledge collected by the exelban/stats project
(https://github.com/exelban/stats), distributed under the MIT License, which in
turn draws on the hardware documentation published by acidanthera's VirtualSMC
project (https://github.com/acidanthera/VirtualSMC), distributed under the
BSD 3-Clause License.

The AppleSMC user-client call convention (the SMCParamStruct layout) is an
interoperability interface, reproduced independently by many projects including
SMCKit (MIT) and exelban/stats (MIT). No code was copied from smcFanControl.

