Safety notice
------------------------------------------------------------------------
SpeedyFan writes to the AppleSMC through a privileged helper and can set fan
speeds below those the firmware would choose on its own. Section 7 (Disclaimer
of Warranty) and Section 8 (Limitation of Liability) of the Apache License
apply in full. Running this software is at your own risk, including the risk of
thermal damage to hardware.
